# GitHub MCP Server
## Installation
### Usage in other MCP Hosts
```json
{
  "mcp": {
    "inputs": [\
      {\
        "type": "promptString",\
        "id": "github_token",\
        "description": "GitHub Personal Access Token",\
        "password": true\
      }\
    ],
    "servers": {
      "github": {
        "command": "docker",
        "args": [\
          "run",\
          "-i",\
          "--rm",\
          "-e",\
          "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN",\
          "ghcr.io/github/github-mcp-server"\
        ],
        "env": {
          "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "${input:github_token}"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

